{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026yU7DXpGAs21794388556.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>網上流傳一段車Cam片段，片主駕駛車輛在一處路口停下等候交通燈號，當時現場交通相當繁忙，交界處不斷有其他車輛來回駛過。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-11-17h00m20s256.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026zceRY3OSfQ1794388282.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-11-16h27m42s424.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20269MmuODHE0A1794388289.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>然而，正當片主靜候燈號之際，前方突然有一輛黑色七人車迎面駛至。該輛七人車疑行錯路，竟當場逆線行駛並橫越行人過路處。隨後，七人車更在片主車頭極近距離前切過並停下，強行轉入另一路口等候燈號，場面令人捏一把汗。</p><p></p><p>上載影片的片主事後在發文時留言直言：「下次小心啲，成家俾你嚇死」，大批網民紛紛發聲指責該司機駕駛態度過分兼極具危險性，留言：「盲人一樣可以揸車」、「做咗佢未呀？」、「咁樣適合揸車？」，直指有關行為極易引致嚴重交通意外。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T10:36:44.833884+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":272,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T09:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T10:29:52.962906+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T10:29:52.962906+00:00","content_hash":"e571459a84e7a47fe49afccedc6a662153de815849519e67f0a7f8e668b30d7e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}